  "extractionNotes": "Mandate contract (0411) with voluntary sickness insurance; Z-3a shows a declared base of 200.00 for every month 2024-10..2025-05 (May 29 of 31 days), so the title and sickness start are taken as 2024-10-01 (inferred; the register start is not printed). ZUS memo: claim for maternity benefit 2025-05-30..2026-05-31, base date and examination date 2025-05-30. The printed end date is three days longer than 52 weeks; the plan uses the statutory 140 + 224 days and the split is inferred. ZUS note of 2025-07-01: letter to the payer to file correct registration documents in connection with the claimant receiving maternity benefit, which is the only evidence of the grant. With a 200 zł base the benefit is far below the 1000 zł minimum, so a top-up is expected (inferred; no single-title statement in the file). ZAM handwriting barely legible; rate not known."
